    {
      "block_id": 11,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "After building the data structure, you need to tell the system to display it. This section describes \nthe display of sprites in “ automatic” mode. In this mode, once the sprite DMA channel begins to \nretrieve and display the data, the display continues until the VSTOP position is reached. Manual \nmode is described later on in this chapter.\n",
      "bbox": [
        85.55000305175781,
        307.8595275878906,
        517.7195434570312,
        357.19757080078125
      ],
